# Build context for .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile.
#
# ClusterFuzzLite builds from a fresh checkout in CI, where the tracked tree is ~19 MB.
# Locally the same directory carries multi-gigabyte scratch that is not tracked at all
# (dev/campaigns alone is several GB; .reference/ and node_modules/ are wholly
# untracked), so without this the local image build ships a context two orders of
# magnitude larger than the one CI produces. Everything listed here is either generated
# or developer-local, and nothing under it is read by the Gradle build — dev/ appears in
# build.gradle.kts only inside a comment pointing at the measurements ledger.
build/
*/build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.git/

.reference/
node_modules/
dev/campaigns/
